  {
   "id": "cooking-companions-132788@major-2022-07-27",
   "gameId": "cooking-companions-132788",
   "displayName": "BIG FREE UPDATE is live!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2022-07-27T17:52:13.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "IT'S HERE",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "The big story update is LIVE! Enjoy a few more hours of content in an all new chapter: \"Chompettes Origins\".",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-Nightmare mode has received an overhaul as well: more events and endings throughout it!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-Four endings have been added to the game!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-More horror: featuring the works of Sam \"Ice\" Woodrick (Lily's Well), Nikki Kalpa (THEY SPEAK FROM THE ABYSS), and other incredible artists!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-DOUBLE the achievements: go secret hunting, or aim for a specific ending!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-More music: over",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-Additional NG+ events!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "How to Unlock in 10 seconds or less",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "1. Click the \"New Game\" button from the main menu.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2. Play the game normally until you reach the first line of dialogue.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "3. Go the main menu, hit the new game button.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "4. You'll now see \"Chompettes Origins\" selectable. Alternatively: just play through the game and you'll see the new content!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Performance Improvements on Older Computers",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Having performance issues with an older computer? This may be due to the engine rendering: try this, Shift+G, then select a different rendering method. Restart the game and see if that fixes it!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "What if I've already played Cooking Companions?",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Play through Chompettes Origins and go through Nightmare Mode and NG+: content has been added to everything past a fresh \"normal\" playthrough!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "I'm getting an error message when I try a new game!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "With internal testing: we discovered there is a chance your older save files are causing an issue with the update. There are two ways to fix this:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "1) Open Steam",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "2) Go into the Library tab",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "3) Right-click Cooking Companions",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "4) Go to Manage > Browse Local Files",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "5) Go back to the previous folder (the folder that showed when you pressed \"Browse local files\" on Steam)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "new",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "6) Select all the content inside this folder and delete it",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "7) Go back to your Steam Library",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "8) Right-click over Cooking Companions;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "9) Manage > Uninstall to uninstall your game",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "10) Install the game again",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "OR uninstall Cooking Companions and delete the folder at Program Files>Steam>steamapps>common>Cooking Companions",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Take Cabbage with you!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Coming soon: survive ANY basement with the help of Cabbage! Check it out here",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Special thanks to all returning players of Cooking Companions: your fanart, music, theories and videos were incredible!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-Deer Dream Studios",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "For more updates and sneak peeks, follow us on Twitter: @DeerDreamStudio",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
